#: .\static\HLC\JS\HLCcontroller.js:191
msgid ""
"Welcome to Horseless Carriage Online!</b><BR/>If you have any suggestions, "
"questions or comments, then please do contact the webmaster at <img "
"src='/static/Lobby/email.png' width='400px' height='30px'>. Thanks!"
